OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSoon turning
OL,6,Fwet and windy this evening as a band
OL,7,Fof rain, occasionally heavy, moves
OL,8,Fsoutheastwards. Conditions become
OL,9,Fdrier later in the night with some
OL,10,Fclear spells developing, although it
OL,11,Fwill remain breezy throughout.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FA mixture of sunny spells and
OL,14,Fshowers, some of which will be heavy
OL,15,Fand perhaps thundery. Winds freshening
OL,16,Fonce again to give a rather cool feel
OL,17,Fto the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
