OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells and isolated mainly coastal
OL,7,Fshowers Wednesday, wind easing. Dry
OL,8,Fstart Thursday, but breezy with rain
OL,9,Flater. Early rain Friday clearing.
OL,10,FTemperatures around average for early
OL,11,FSeptember.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
